menu "sys_device"

    config SYS_DEVICE_MAX
        int "Registered devices"
        default 32
        range 1 1024
        help
          How many devices can be registered at once (any IDs 0..0xFFFE).
          One entry is an ID, a type and its struct pointer (8 bytes).

    config SYS_DEVICE_TYPES
        int "Device types"
        default 16
        range 1 255
        help
          Device types that can be registered (one router each).

    config SYS_DEVICE_MAX_DEPS
        int "Devices one device may use"
        default 4
        range 1 16
        help
          Distinct devices one device declares with sys_device_use() (the
          devices its pins are on, ...). Pins on the same device count once.

endmenu
